
# <type>(<scope>): <summary>
#
# Summary: imperative mood, no trailing period, max 72 chars.
#   e.g. feat(tracker): add idle detection to screen time tracker
#
# Allowed types and scopes: see commitlint.config.ts (single source of truth).
# Breaking change: add "!" after the scope, e.g. feat(api)!: ...
#
# --- Body (required, wrap at 72 chars) ---
# Keep "Why:" and "What:" on their own lines. "Why: text" on one line
# looks like a Git trailer (Key: value) and is parsed as a footer.
#
# Why:
# <the problem or motivation behind this change>
#
# What:
# - <notable change>
# - <notable change>
#
# --- Footer ---
# Closes #<issue>
# Refs #<issue>
# BREAKING CHANGE: <what breaks and how to migrate>
